OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner praises Corrie male
OL,4,Abreast cancer story
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who survived breast cancer says
OL,7,Fhe welcomes Coronation Street's
OL,8,Fstoryline about the disease, which is
OL,9,Foften associated with women.
OL,11,FDave Talbot, 69, from Olveston, South
OL,12,FGloucestershire, has been raising
OL,13,Fawareness of male breast cancer since
OL,14,Fhe was diagnosed in 2015.
OL,16,FThe charity Breast Cancer Now said most
OL,17,Fpeople do not realise that men can get
OL,18,Fbreast cancer. About 400 men are
OL,19,Fdiagnosed each year in the UK, compared
OL,20,Fto 55,000 women.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
