OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner praises Corrie male
OL,4,Abreast cancer story
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If Corrie's decision to go down this
OL,7,Fstory can save one life, that's
OL,8,Fbrilliant," said Talbot.
